  `j`-th largest entry in `input`, and its index is `indices[j]`.

  >>> result = tf.math.top_k([1, 2, 98, 1, 1, 99, 3, 1, 3, 96, 4, 1],
  ...                         k=3)
  >>> result.values.numpy()
  array([99, 98, 96], dtype=int32)
  >>> result.indices.numpy()
  array([5, 2, 9], dtype=int32)

